msgid "The team has frozen your review; it can no longer be changed."
msgstr "团队已冻结您的审阅，无法再修改。"

msgid "Your proposal was saved."
msgstr "您的提议已保存。"

msgid "This proposal was changed in another tab after you opened this page. The saved text is shown below; please make your change again."
msgstr "在您打开此页面之后，此提议已在另一个标签页中被修改。下方显示的是已保存的内容；请重新进行您的修改。"

msgid "The proposal was deleted."
msgstr "提议已删除。"

msgid "Your question was sent to the team. Their answer will appear here."
msgstr "您的问题已发送给团队。团队的回答将显示在这里。"

msgid "Please write your question first."
msgstr "请先写下您的问题。"

msgid "Version %(n)s confirmed. You can still revise it until the team freezes your review."
msgstr "已确认第 %(n)s 版。在团队冻结您的审阅之前，您仍可修改。"

msgid "Confidential: these items are the benchmark's answers. Please do not publish or share them."
msgstr "保密：这些条目是评测基准的答案。请勿公开或分享。"

msgid "Version %(n)s, confirmed %(date)s UTC"
msgstr "第 %(n)s 版，确认于 %(date)s（UTC）"

msgid "Proposed additions"
msgstr "提议新增的条目"

msgid "I understand that the finished task, built from my package, will be sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "我了解：根据我的材料构建的最终任务，将通过各家 AI 公司的 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "Taking part requires this acknowledgement."
msgstr "参与需要您确认此项。"

msgid "I understand that the finished task, built from this paper's package and the reviews, will be sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "我了解：根据这篇论文的材料和审阅意见构建的最终任务，将通过各家 AI 公司的 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "May the team use AI services with my unpublished materials and my responses?"
msgstr "团队可以将 AI 服务用于我未公开的材料和我的回复吗？"

msgid "Upload a ZIP file here"
msgstr "在此上传一个 ZIP 文件"

