msgstr "所需的硬件或内存（可选）"

msgid "I confirm that nothing restricted or confidential is included in what I send."
msgstr "我确认我发送的材料中不包含任何受限或保密的内容。"

msgid "I confirm that I may share the data I include with the project."
msgstr "我确认我有权与本项目共享我所包含的数据。"

