msgstr "备注"

msgid "Choose how the materials reach us."
msgstr "请选择材料送达我们的方式。"

msgid "Upload your package (a ZIP file), or choose another way to send it."
msgstr "请上传您的材料包（一个 ZIP 文件），或选择其他发送方式。"

