msgstr "请说明您与团队商定的渠道。"

msgid "An upload is not finished. Finish it, or remove it."
msgstr "有一个上传尚未完成。请完成或删除它。"

msgid "Name the master script, the README, and the software with its version."
msgstr "请写明主脚本、README 以及软件及其版本。"

