msgstr "检查并确认"

msgid "These are your answers, in your own words. Confirming saves them as a numbered version; you can still revise them until the team freezes your review."
msgstr "以下是您用自己的话写下的回答。确认后会保存为一个带编号的版本；在团队冻结您的审阅之前，您仍可修改。"

