msgstr "本网站只能通过团队发给您的个人链接打开，无需注册，也没有搜索功能。"

msgid "If your link no longer works, please ask the team for a new one."
msgstr "如果您的链接已无法使用，请向团队索取新链接。"

msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "开始之前"

msgid "What this is"
msgstr "这是什么"

msgid "The team has prepared items for a benchmark task built from your paper. The items are deliberate modifications made to build the task, not claims about your published paper. You review them: keep, change, reject, or mark as unsure, and you may propose others."
msgstr "团队已根据您的论文，为一项评测基准任务准备了若干条目。这些条目是为构建任务而有意做出的修改，并非对您已发表论文的论断。请您逐条审阅：保留、修改、拒绝或标记为不确定，也可以提出新的条目。"

msgid "The team has prepared items for a benchmark task built from this paper. The items are deliberate modifications made to build the task, not claims about the published paper. You review them: keep, change, reject, or mark as unsure, and you may propose others."
msgstr "团队已根据这篇论文，为一项评测基准任务准备了若干条目。这些条目是为构建任务而有意做出的修改，并非对已发表论文的论断。请您逐条审阅：保留、修改、拒绝或标记为不确定，也可以提出新的条目。"

msgid "What is stored, and who sees it"
msgstr "保存哪些内容，谁能看到"

msgid "Your decisions, comments, proposals, and uploaded files, with their dates."
msgstr "您的决定、评论、提议和上传的文件，以及相应的日期。"

msgid "Only the project team sees them; other contributors do not."
msgstr "只有项目团队能看到；其他贡献者看不到。"

msgid "What happens to the finished task"
msgstr "最终任务将如何使用"

msgid "The finished task, built from your package, is used to evaluate AI models. It is sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "根据您的材料构建的最终任务将用于评测 AI 模型。它会通过 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家 AI 公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "The finished task, built from this paper's package and the reviews, is used to evaluate AI models. It is sent through their APIs to each AI company whose models are evaluated, which receives it and may keep it."
msgstr "根据这篇论文的材料和审阅意见构建的最终任务将用于评测 AI 模型。它会通过 API 发送给模型接受评测的每一家 AI 公司；这些公司会收到并可能保存该任务。"

msgid "The task may later be published. Your reviews, comments, and messages are not published."
msgstr "该任务以后可能会公开发布。您的审阅意见、评论和留言不会公开。"

msgid "What we ask of you"
msgstr "我们请您做到"

msgid "Please keep the items confidential: do not publish or share them."
msgstr "请对这些条目保密：不要公开或分享。"

msgid "If you use AI tools, write what you submit in your own words, tell us when AI helped, and never put restricted, confidential, or licensed data into an AI tool."
msgstr "如果您使用 AI 工具，请用自己的话撰写提交的内容，在 AI 提供帮助时告诉我们，并且切勿将受限、保密或受许可限制的数据输入 AI 工具。"

msgid "You may withdraw at any time by telling the team; your reviews, proposals, and uploads are then deleted."
msgstr "您可以随时告知团队退出；届时您的审阅意见、提议和上传内容将被删除。"

msgid "You last confirmed these choices on %(date)s. You can change them below."
msgstr "您最近一次确认这些选择是在 %(date)s。您可以在下方修改。"

msgid "Either answer is fine. You can change it later."
msgstr "两种回答都可以，之后也可以修改。"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Choose a paper"
msgstr "选择论文"

msgid "Your personal link opens one paper at a time: the one you choose here. You can change it at any time, and your work on each paper is kept."
msgstr "您的个人链接每次只打开一篇论文，即您在此处选择的那一篇。您可以随时更换，您在每篇论文上的工作都会被保留。"

msgid "Your current paper"
msgstr "您当前的论文"

msgid "Continue with this paper"
msgstr "继续审阅这篇论文"

msgid "Other papers you can choose"
msgstr "您可以选择的其他论文"

msgid "Papers you can choose"
msgstr "您可以选择的论文"

msgid "You have opened this paper before; your choices on it are kept."
msgstr "您之前打开过这篇论文，您对它所做的选择已被保留。"

msgid "Choose this paper"
msgstr "选择这篇论文"

msgid "No other papers are open to you at the moment. The team will tell you when there are more."
msgstr "目前没有其他可供您选择的论文。有新的论文时，团队会通知您。"

msgid "No papers are open to you yet. The team will tell you when there are some."
msgstr "目前还没有可供您选择的论文。有可选论文时，团队会通知您。"

msgid "Edit your proposal"
msgstr "编辑您的提议"

msgid "Propose an error or a missing step that the team did not prepare: where it is, what would change, why it matters, and how to fix it."
msgstr "提议团队未准备的错误或缺失步骤：它在哪里、会改变什么、为什么重要，以及如何修正。"

msgid "Save the proposal"
msgstr "保存提议"

msgid "Delete it"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "编辑"

msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "矩阵视图"

msgid "This item was saved from another tab or window after you opened this page. The saved answer is shown below; please make your change again."
msgstr "在您打开此页面之后，此条目已在另一个标签页或窗口中被保存。下方显示的是已保存的回答；请重新进行您的修改。"

msgid "The team has updated the items since you answered this one. Your answer to the earlier version was: %(verdict)s. Please answer this version."
msgstr "在您回答此条目之后，团队更新了条目。您对先前版本的回答是：%(verdict)s。请回答当前版本。"

msgid "Your comment then:"
msgstr "您当时的评论："

msgid "Whole picture"
msgstr "全局视图"

msgid "Two versions of one key point"
msgstr "同一关键点的两个版本"

msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "Clear the highlight"
msgstr "取消高亮"

msgid "Select a result to highlight the items that affect it."
msgstr "选择一项结果，即可高亮显示影响它的条目。"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "上一项"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一项"

msgid "This key point was prepared in two versions; both are shown with equal weight, in the same order on both items' pages."
msgstr "这个关键点准备了两个版本，两者以同等权重显示，并且在两个条目的页面上顺序相同。"

msgid "this item"
msgstr "本条目"

msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "正在保存…"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "已保存"

msgid "Not saved: this item was changed in another tab. Reload the page."
msgstr "未保存：此条目已在另一个标签页中被修改。请重新加载页面。"

msgid "Not saved: no connection. Your text is still here; try again."
msgstr "未保存：没有网络连接。您的文字仍保留在这里，请重试。"

msgid "Not saved: please check the highlighted fields."
msgstr "未保存：请检查标出的字段。"

msgid "Not saved: the review is frozen."
msgstr "未保存：审阅已被冻结。"

msgid "Not saved: your session has ended. Copy your text, then open your personal link again."
msgstr "未保存：您的会话已结束。请先复制您的文字，然后重新打开您的个人链接。"

msgid "Not saved: the site could not save this answer. Copy your text, then reload the page."
msgstr "未保存：网站无法保存此回答。请先复制您的文字，然后重新加载页面。"

msgid "Not saved yet: choose an answer, and your notes are saved with it."
msgstr "尚未保存：请选择一个回答，您的备注会随之一起保存。"

msgid "Loading your latest saved answer…"
msgstr "正在加载您最近保存的回答…"

msgid "Not saved: your earlier save arrived after this page was loaded. Copy your text, then reload the page."
msgstr "未保存：您之前的保存在此页面加载之后才完成。请先复制您的文字，然后重新加载页面。"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "“First” and “second” are the versions as shown above; your choice is one answer for the pair, shared by both items."
msgstr "“第一个”和“第二个”指上方显示的版本；您的选择是对这一对版本的同一个回答，两个条目共用。"

msgid "Reasons, ticks, and comments"
msgstr "理由、勾选项和评论"

msgid "Shortcuts: arrow keys for previous and next; K, C, R, U for the four answers."
msgstr "快捷键：左右方向键切换上一项和下一项；K、C、R、U 分别对应四种回答（保留、修改后保留、拒绝、不确定）。"

msgid "Back to the map"
msgstr "返回全局视图"

msgid "Results and items"
msgstr "结果与条目"

msgid "Each mark shows an item that affects a result. Select an item to review it."
msgstr "每个标记表示一个影响该结果的条目。选择一个条目即可审阅。"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "affects"
msgstr "影响"

msgid "We need a full replication package that runs from the raw inputs to every table and figure, as a journal data editor would accept it. Code and documentation without the data, or without a way to run with the data, let us read the work but not run it."
msgstr "我们需要一份完整的复现材料包，能够从原始输入一直运行到每一张表格和图形，达到期刊数据编辑可以接受的标准。只有代码和文档而没有数据，或者没有使用数据运行的途径，我们只能阅读这些工作，而无法运行。"

msgid "We need the sources of the paper as listed below, with your original file names."
msgstr "我们需要下列论文源文件，并保留您的原始文件名。"

msgid "What to provide"
msgstr "需要提供什么"

msgid "Your public package (%(repo)s %(ident)s, %(version)s) may already contain several of these. Confirm those, and send only what is missing."
msgstr "您的公开材料包（%(repo)s %(ident)s，%(version)s）可能已包含其中若干项。请确认这些项目，只发送缺少的部分。"

msgid "The list follows the journals' Data and Code Availability Standard and its template README, so a package prepared for publication usually needs little more."
msgstr "此清单遵循期刊的《数据与代码可得性标准》及其 README 模板，因此为发表而准备的材料包通常只需少量补充。"

msgid "How to prepare it"
msgstr "如何准备"

msgid "Keep your original folder structure and file names. We map them to the task files ourselves."
msgstr "请保留原有的文件夹结构和文件名。我们会自行将其与任务文件对应。"

msgid "Do not tidy the code: we need it as it produced your results."
msgstr "请不要整理代码：我们需要的是产生您结果时的原样代码。"

msgid "Use relative paths, so that the package runs from any folder."
msgstr "请使用相对路径，使材料包可以在任何文件夹中运行。"

msgid "Run the master script once from a clean copy, and keep the log and the outputs it produced."
msgstr "请从一份干净的副本运行一次主脚本，并保留日志及其产生的输出。"

msgid "Data"
msgstr "数据"

msgid "For each dataset, choose one route:"
msgstr "请为每个数据集选择一种途径："

msgid "The dataset"
msgstr "数据集"

msgid "What to do"
msgstr "怎么做"

msgid "You may share it"
msgstr "您可以共享它"

msgid "Include it in the upload. It is stored encrypted on the project's server, for the team only."
msgstr "请将其包含在上传中。它会加密保存在项目服务器上，仅供团队使用。"

msgid "It is public elsewhere"
msgstr "它在其他地方公开"

msgid "Give its source and version; we download it ourselves."
msgstr "请提供其来源和版本；我们会自行下载。"

msgid "Restricted or confidential"
msgstr "受限或保密"

msgid "Never upload it. Choose a route: you or your RA run our versions where the data are and return only the outputs; we apply to the provider for access; a secure environment where authorized team members run it; or a fully synthetic substitute built from the codebook (then we check only that the code runs)."
msgstr "切勿上传。请选择一种途径：由您或您的研究助理在数据所在之处运行我们的各个版本，只返回输出；由我们向数据提供方申请访问权限；在安全环境中由获得授权的团队成员运行；或者使用根据编码手册构建的完全合成的替代数据（此时我们只检查代码能否运行）。"

msgid "Not yet decided"
msgstr "尚未决定"

msgid "Record it as to be decided; we will follow up with you."
msgstr "请记为“待定”；我们会与您跟进。"

msgid "If you include data, you confirm that you may share them with the project. A team member checks each dataset's terms before anyone opens it."
msgstr "如果您包含数据，即表示您确认有权与本项目共享这些数据。在任何人打开数据之前，会由一名团队成员核查每个数据集的条款。"

msgid "How to send it"
msgstr "如何发送"

msgid "Upload one ZIP file of up to %(size)s. If the connection breaks, choose the same file again and the upload continues where it stopped. You receive its SHA-256, a fingerprint you can compare with your own copy."
msgstr "上传一个最大 %(size)s 的 ZIP 文件。如果连接中断，请再次选择同一个文件，上传会从中断处继续。您会收到它的 SHA-256，这是一个可与您自己的副本核对的指纹。"

msgid "Or give the public package's reference (repository, identifier, version) and upload only what is missing."
msgstr "或者提供公开材料包的引用信息（存储库、标识符、版本），只上传缺少的部分。"

msgid "Or use another channel agreed with the team, for example an institutional transfer for a very large package."
msgstr "或者使用与团队商定的其他渠道，例如对非常大的材料包使用机构传输服务。"

msgid "Go to Submit"
msgstr "前往提交"

msgid "Using AI tools"
msgstr "使用 AI 工具"

msgid "You may use AI tools such as ChatGPT or DeepSeek while you review the items and prepare your materials. Please follow three rules."
msgstr "您在审阅条目和准备材料时，可以使用 ChatGPT、DeepSeek 等 AI 工具。请遵守以下三条规则。"

msgid "Your judgment, in your own words."
msgstr "您的判断，您自己的表述。"

msgid "Everything you write for us (each decision, reason, comment, and proposed error, and any README text you write) should state your own judgment and be written, or rewritten, by you. This does not apply to your original code and data, which we need exactly as they are. Please do not paste AI output as it is."
msgstr "您为我们撰写的每项内容（每个决定、理由、评论、新提出的错误，以及您撰写的 README 文字）都应表达您本人的判断，并由您亲自撰写或改写。此规则不适用于您原有的代码和数据：我们需要它们保持原样。请不要直接粘贴 AI 的输出。"

msgid "Tell us if AI helped."
msgstr "如有 AI 协助，请告诉我们。"

msgid "Tick “AI helped with this”, name the tool and the type of account (work or personal), and say whether you entered the items or the task package."
msgstr "请勾选“AI 协助了此项”，注明所用工具和账户类型（工作账户或个人账户），并说明是否输入了条目或任务包。"

msgid "Never put restricted, confidential, or licensed data into any AI tool."
msgstr "任何情况下都不要将受限、保密或受许可限制的数据输入任何 AI 工具。"

msgid "If you put the items or the task package into an AI tool, we recommend a work or business account, or a personal account with model training switched off; please do not use the rating or feedback buttons in those conversations, and do not share them publicly. This lowers the chance that the material is used to train future models, but it does not stop the AI company from receiving and keeping it. That is why we ask you to tell us."
msgstr "如果您将条目或任务包输入 AI 工具，我们建议使用工作或企业账户，或已关闭模型训练的个人账户；请不要在这些对话中使用评分或反馈按钮，也不要公开分享对话。这样可以降低这些材料被用于训练未来模型的可能性，但无法阻止 AI 公司接收并保存这些材料。因此，我们请您告诉我们。"

msgid "Why this matters"
msgstr "为什么这很重要"

msgid "The benchmark tests whether AI systems can do economics research well: for example, whether they find and correct mistakes that economists consider plausible and consequential, or notice and supply a necessary step that was removed. Your judgment is the standard the AI is measured against. If AI-written reasoning entered the tasks unchanged, the benchmark would partly measure agreement with another AI rather than with an economist."
msgstr "本评测基准检验 AI 系统能否胜任经济学研究，例如能否发现并纠正经济学家认为确实可能出现且有实质性影响的失误，或发现并补上被删除的必要步骤。您的判断就是衡量 AI 的标准。如果 AI 撰写的推理原封不动地进入任务，评测基准在一定程度上衡量的就成了与另一个 AI 的一致程度，而非与经济学家的一致程度。"

msgid "AI-written text has recognizable patterns. An AI being tested could use them to find the answers without doing the economics."
msgstr "AI 撰写的文字有可辨认的模式。接受测试的 AI 可能借助这些模式找到答案，而无需进行经济学推理。"

msgid "Tasks shaped by one AI model can be easier or harder for models of the same family, which would make comparisons between AI systems unfair."
msgstr "由某个 AI 模型塑造的任务，对同一系列的模型可能更容易或更难，这会使不同 AI 系统之间的比较有失公平。"

msgid "The items are the benchmark's answers. If an AI company trains on them, its future models could score well by memory rather than by reasoning. We cannot rule this out entirely, so we record which companies have seen which items and report those results separately."
msgstr "这些条目就是本评测基准的标准答案。如果某家 AI 公司用它们训练模型，其未来的模型就可能靠记忆而非推理取得高分。我们无法完全排除这种可能，因此会记录哪些公司接触过哪些条目，并单独报告相应的结果。"

msgid "Your answers are saved as a draft until you submit. Each submission is a numbered version; you can change your answers and submit again."
msgstr "在您提交之前，您的回答会保存为草稿。每次提交都是一个编号的版本；您可以修改回答并再次提交。"

msgid "Submitted versions"
msgstr "已提交的版本"

msgid "received by the team"
msgstr "团队已收到"

msgid "checked by the team"
msgstr "团队已核验"

msgid "Manifest SHA-256"
msgstr "清单 SHA-256"

msgid "Before you submit:"
msgstr "提交之前："

msgid "Your uploads"
msgstr "您的上传"

msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "%(counter)s file inside"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s files inside"
msgstr[0] "内含 %(counter)s 个文件"

msgid "Received"
msgstr "已收到"

msgid "Being checked"
msgstr "正在核验"

msgid "Unfinished: %(done)s received. Choose the same file again to continue."
msgstr "未完成：已收到 %(done)s。请再次选择同一个文件以继续。"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "No upload yet."
msgstr "尚无上传。"

msgid "Sending…"
msgstr "正在发送…"

msgid "Received; computing its SHA-256…"
msgstr "已收到；正在计算其 SHA-256…"

msgid "Received. SHA-256:"
msgstr "已收到。SHA-256："

msgid "Paused: the connection was lost. Choose the same file again to continue where it stopped."
msgstr "已暂停：连接中断。请再次选择同一个文件，从中断处继续。"

msgid "Not received:"
msgstr "未收到："

msgid "Choose your ZIP file (up to %(size)s)"
msgstr "选择您的 ZIP 文件（最大 %(size)s）"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

msgid "To compare the SHA-256 with your own copy: on macOS or Linux, run shasum -a 256 followed by the file name; on Windows, run certutil -hashfile followed by the file name and SHA256."
msgstr "如需与您自己的副本核对 SHA-256：在 macOS 或 Linux 上运行 shasum -a 256 加文件名；在 Windows 上运行 certutil -hashfile 加文件名和 SHA256。"

msgid "The public package"
msgstr "公开的材料包"

msgid "The package"
msgstr "材料包"

msgid "Datasets"
msgstr "数据集"

msgid "One row per dataset the code uses. Save to add another row."
msgstr "代码使用的每个数据集占一行。保存后可再添加一行。"

msgid "Dataset %(n)s"
msgstr "数据集 %(n)s"

msgid "Remove this dataset"
msgstr "删除此数据集"

msgid "Checklist"
msgstr "清单"

msgid "Declarations"
msgstr "声明"

msgid "Needed only if you include data. A team member checks each dataset's terms before anyone opens it."
msgstr "仅在您包含数据时需要。在任何人打开数据之前，会由一名团队成员核查每个数据集的条款。"

msgid "Submit"
msgstr "提交"
